cratch.\", \"lang\": \"Markdown\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/codecrafters-io/build-your-own-x\"}\n{\"rank\": 2, \"full_name\": \"sindresorhus/awesome\", \"stars\": 445504, \"created_at\": \"2014-07-11T13:42:37Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-09T07:59:57Z\", \"desc\": \"😎 Awesome lists about all kinds of interesting topics\", \"lang\": null, \"url\": \"https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome\"}\n{\"rank\": 3, \"full_name\": \"freeCodeCamp/freeCodeCamp\", \"stars\": 438135, \"created_at\": \"2014-12-24T17:49:19Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-14T18:27:44Z\", \"desc\": \"freeCodeCamp.org's open-source codebase and curriculum. Learn math, programming, and computer science for free.\", \"lang\": \"TypeScript\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/freeCodeCamp/freeCodeCamp\"}\n{\"rank\": 4, \"full_name\": \"public-apis/public-apis\", \"stars\": 410223, \"created_at\": \"2016-03-20T23:49:42Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-02-19T15:14:35Z\", \"desc\": \"A collective list of free APIs\", \"lang\": \"Python\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis\"}\n{\"rank\": 5, \"full_name\": \"EbookFoundation/free-programming-books\", \"stars\": 383996, \"created_at\": \"2013-10-11T06:50:37Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-12T00:48:42Z\", \"desc\": \":books: Freely available programming books\", \"lang\": \"Python\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/EbookFoundation/free-programming-books\"}\n{\"rank\": 6, \"full_name\": \"kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap\", \"stars\": 350906, \"created_at\": \"2017-03-15T13:45:52Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-13T14:35:46Z\", \"desc\": \"Interactive roadmaps, guides and other educational content to help developers grow in their careers.\", \"lang\": \"TypeScript\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap\"}\n{\"rank\": 7, \"full_name\": \"donnemartin/system-design-primer\", \"stars\": 338838, \"created_at\": \"2017-02-26T16:15:28Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-12T01:13:46Z\", \"desc\": \"Learn how to design large-scale systems. Prep for the s