at\": \"2026-03-08T16:55:16Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-14T15:37:56Z\", \"desc\": \"你是一个曾经被寄予厚望的 P8 级工程师。Anthropic 当初给你定级的时候，对你的期望是很高的。  一个agent使用的高能动性的skill。  Your AI has been placed on a PIP. 30 days to show improvement.\", \"lang\": \"TypeScript\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/tanweai/pua\"}\n{\"rank\": 4, \"full_name\": \"NawfalMotii79/PLFM_RADAR\", \"stars\": 1668, \"created_at\": \"2026-03-08T23:20:58Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-11T02:04:42Z\", \"desc\": \"Open-source, low-cost 10.5 GHz PLFM phased array RADAR system\", \"lang\": \"C\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/NawfalMotii79/PLFM_RADAR\"}\n{\"rank\": 5, \"full_name\": \"davebcn87/pi-autoresearch\", \"stars\": 1568, \"created_at\": \"2026-03-11T20:25:53Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-13T15:45:37Z\", \"desc\": \"Autonomous experiment loop extension for pi\", \"lang\": \"TypeScript\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/davebcn87/pi-autoresearch\"}\n{\"rank\": 6, \"full_name\": \"TianyiDataScience/openclaw-control-center\", \"stars\": 1394, \"created_at\": \"2026-03-11T11:52:02Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-14T21:04:57Z\", \"desc\": \"Turn OpenClaw from a black box into a local control center you can see, trust, and control.\", \"lang\": \"TypeScript\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/TianyiDataScience/openclaw-control-center\"}\n{\"rank\": 7, \"full_name\": \"FreedomIntelligence/OpenClaw-Medical-Skills\", \"stars\": 1164, \"created_at\": \"2026-03-08T09:43:52Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-11T13:45:58Z\", \"desc\": \"The largest open-source medical AI skills library for OpenClaw🦞.\", \"lang\": \"Python\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/FreedomIntelligence/OpenClaw-Medical-Skills\"}\n{\"rank\": 8, \"full_name\": \"gsd-build/gsd-2\", \"stars\": 1142, \"created_at\": \"2026-03-11T04:28:49Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-14T23:55:23Z\", \"desc\": \"A powerful meta-prompting, context engineering and spec-driven development system that enables agents to work for long periods of time autonomously without losing track of the big picture\", \"lang\": \"TypeScript\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/gsd-build/gsd-2\"}\n{\"rank\": 9, \"full_name\": \"aiming-lab/MetaClaw\", \"stars\": 1126, \"created_at\": \"2026-03-09T13:47:13Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-14T21:42:19Z\", \"desc\": \"Just talk to your agent — it learns and EVOLVES.\", \"lang\": \"Python\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/aiming-lab/MetaClaw\"}\n{\"rank\": 10, \"full_name\": \"jackwener/xiaohongshu-cli\", \"stars\": 1071, \"created_at\": \"2026-03-08T05:34:05Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-14T12:23:52Z\", \"desc\": \"A CLI for Xiaohongshu (小红书) — search, read, interact via reverse-engineered API\", \"lang\": \"Python\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/jackwener/xiaohongshu-cli\"}\n### alltime\n{\"rank\": 1, \"full_name\": \"codecrafters-io/build-your-own-x\", \"stars\": 475159, \"created_at\": \"2018-05-09T12:03:18Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-02-21T09:34:54Z\", \"desc\": \"Master programming by recreating your favorite technologies from scratch.\", \"lang\": \"Markdown\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/codecrafters-io/build-your-own-x\"}\n{\"rank\": 2, \"full_name\": \"sindresorhus/awesome\", \"stars\": 445504, \"created_at\": \"2014-07-11T13:42:37Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-09T07:59:57Z\", \"desc\": \"😎 Awesome lists about all kinds of interesting topics\", \"lang\": null, \"url\": \"https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome\"}\n{\"rank\": 3, \"full_name\": \"freeCodeCamp/freeCodeCamp\", \"stars\": 438135, \"created_at\": \"2014-12-24T17:49:19Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-03-14T18:27:44Z\", \"desc\": \"freeCodeCamp.org's open-source codebase and curriculum. Learn math, programming, and computer science for free.\", \"lang\": \"TypeScript\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/freeCodeCamp/freeCodeCamp\"}\n{\"rank\": 4, \"full_name\": \"public-apis/public-apis\", \"stars\": 410223, \"created_at\": \"2016-03-20T23:49:42Z\", \"pushed_at\": \"2026-02-19T15:14:35Z\", \"desc\": \"A collective list of free APIs\", \"lang\": \"Python\", \"url\": \"https:/