{"type":"message","id":"08ca9914","parentId":"f534ad82","timestamp":"2026-03-15T00:00:58.982Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Choosing top repositories**\n\nI need to produce a concise output without exceeding 2500 characters. I'm thinking of deduplicating entries and looking for a top 5 list that doesn't overlap with the all-time top 5. It may be wise to implicitly mention the data source, likely GitHub API. \n\nI'm considering focusing on recent activity, so perhaps I should choose openclaw over public-apis for more relevant updates. I'll aim to pick 5 repositories among the top 10, prioritizing those with both high stars and recent activity.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_079497c67bfb17b50169b5f6aa89dc81918d2aa6602c4a78e6\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABptfay4Elq5OfOaSuWt8vS34elyu1_BjXCwBQeiR_xtSJq60zf1bUDrLy9s4rsGEOS0PA6iKj_NMIrZE7iIMzzdynE3vdjP7QeMM4tnGUyXHTI63061fC-N7EFaMS8xS_L5gJPuvuc2LYfOFB9bXWnQFM7QThEx8MUercMQcxlrvUCcnEZM41Ypniu2z3sz_vJe456Txd-wd4YXE-4VTO-g5bPtikJSvAGOoON-a3o5AIQRj6iLveeld5VQm623o3hjtrVhH3YtvPGr_cyxlGBTmo_TUOpo6B-8bdyvZVo9RQ0n7lpdSQZwMS7rBkOukxA7XBX91vVeYDQbRcWt0CmacVcixk1b9Ml9eOJKtbyOf10l6BsoqrfmN5x6khOXmjHuTBL4oKe20KK6AcAmbjS_2qRV-JtIlIbl7Ob_6OQxzotRzJ0HNdYlu2aNj-CEmUQjzDwL6n6ZwKZK1JO9a-uyR8hKxvzkmOlwcgXSixYrRhxZ4WNG3XownWbevyF6U9aMreRCBgloEod5CrZ4oaiqNqNX6cXS4nqv106tNK-hf7BSMM3IVPyNrqvzkKA5bkr_G3dIKmU0Uuyyx3eiujf_QnavSvgpiG4X6AETBOrhjuPyTyKWcn1w6HOOcERAYxZNI9Z_w5mfIPbEHvUWPEH2FyNLYpwf1NbayP82B_7JNQlrfC1uqWuwsuAaYKc_V7HTmHbmKBGk1irL4qmBDA0FEl2FEflgtoPghn3QJIe0RjQwOGK2-BJlk96VCQWAGn1iF82A5inK5XPrYwBnfSmr5Rdx9r2G29zMMZ8LUC7brhC_07b0LsjR7yc0gVnKdCW0iGJnE1wuzcGmoqS593zMnedsw3WKos7b0ssr-_RaMsPhYAGVcSuRnmUrCGcNYs9Vy7jPUxAEmPA4-em_VU7-YRdeH-1dlSNZKywzkvfJwuLaxErg1pq84GkpT2tgyeEbacVJjXT41RWzDlT9qMXLL69wMsiCqrG_nH3OjjbIHe-X9ZyZ_vypvQRr7f3YAwZcIZpxmYWLBORWsqakngSRtowKDJJoMT-v8lHqJEjP2hV2LM8PENJN8b5C1Gsg3UP8di_wxzNIc2RIzV2t16dPiXYA3lAqM9iQ9g5AITDwjjIZBikAA_HZOa_nfQCGoTss9k2C8nI3